{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10088","headline":"客自江南话过亡友朱司议故宅 · 包佶","name":"客自江南话过亡友朱司议故宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"交臂多相共，风流忆此人。\n海翻移里巷，书蠹积埃尘。\n奉佛栖禅久，辞官上疏频。\n故来分半宅，惟是旧交亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包佶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10088.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10088","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}